    {
      "id": "demo-showcase-room-review",
      "title": "上线前的最后一轮评审",
      "kind": "group",
      "agentIds": [
        "agent-planner",
        "agent-reviewer"
      ],
      "projectId": "demo-showcase-project-workbench",
      "mode": "demo",
      "digitalTwinEnabled": true,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-29T07:10:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-29T07:15:00.000Z",
      "messages": [
        {
          "id": "demo-showcase-room-review-m0",
          "role": "user",
          "content": "帮我评审两天发布计划。规划师压缩范围，评审员专门找不能发布的理由。",
          "createdAt": "2026-09-29T07:10:00.000Z",
          "demo": true
        },
        {
          "id": "demo-showcase-room-review-m1",
          "role": "assistant",
          "content": "把来源追溯限制为“从关键判断回到一条来源”，先不做跨来源自动合并。省下来的时间给成果保存和恢复。",
          "createdAt": "2026-09-29T07:11:00.000Z",
          "agentId": "agent-planner",
          "demo": true
        },
        {
          "id": "demo-showcase-room-review-m2",
          "role": "assistant",
          "content": "我反对仅凭页面显示“已保存”就通过。验收要关闭应用后重开，并核对修订内容和版本号；否则保存状态只是界面承诺。",
          "createdAt": "2026-09-29T07:12:00.000Z",
          "agentId": "agent-reviewer",
          "demo": true
        },
        {
          "id": "demo-showcase-room-review-m3",
          "role": "user",
          "content": "接受这个门槛。时间不够就延后发布，不要删验收。",
          "createdAt": "2026-09-29T07:13:00.000Z",
          "demo": true
        },
        {
          "id": "demo-showcase-room-review-m4",
          "role": "assistant",
          "content": "计划已收敛：三个用户结果、一位验收负责人、两个连续开发窗口。评审只看保存、恢复、追溯是否完整走通。",
          "createdAt": "2026-09-29T07:14:00.000Z",
          "agentId": "agent-planner",
          "demo": true
        },
        {
          "id": "demo-showcase-room-review-m5",
          "role": "assistant",
          "content": "我会用三类反例检查：数据丢失、重复执行、来源失效。每项需要可重现步骤；没有证据的部分标为待验证。",
          "createdAt": "2026-09-29T07:15:00.000Z",
          "agentId": "agent-reviewer",
          "demo": true
        }
      ],
      "taskIds": [],
      "demo": true
    }
